574	     7	/**
575	     8	 * Percentile with linear interpolation between closest ranks (the common
576	     9	 * "type 7" definition used by Excel's PERCENTILE.INC and Postgres percentile_cont).
577	    10	 * @param values - numbers (any order; not modified).
578	    11	 * @param p - percentile as a fraction, 0..1 (0.95 = 95th percentile).
